{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40472","headline":"赠镜湖处士方干二首 一 · 曹松","name":"赠镜湖处士方干二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"包含教化剩搜罗，句出东瓯奈峭何。\n世路不妨平处少，才人唯是屈声多。\n云来岛上便幽石，月到湖心忌白波。\n後辈难爲措机杼，先生织字得龙梭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}